  "weeks": [
    {
      "title": "Week 1 · Launch training",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "title": "Welcome aboard, cadet",
          "goal": "Know where we're going, how far it is, and which job you'll do on the crew.",
          "session": {
            "minutes": 50,
            "agenda": [
              {
                "label": "Mission briefing",
                "minutes": 10
              },
              {
                "label": "Pick your crew job",
                "minutes": 10
              },
              {
                "label": "How far is Mars?",
                "minutes": 15
              },
              {
                "label": "Crew huddle",
                "minutes": 15
              }
            ]
          },
          "modules": [
            {
              "id": "c-brief",
              "kind": "content",
              "title": "Your mission briefing",
              "minutes": 3,
              "body": "Good morning, cadet. 🚀\n\nIn three weeks our crew leaves for **Mars**, the red planet. Before then you'll train: how far it is, what to pack, how to breathe and drink when there's no air or rain, and how to build a base.\n\nEvery card is one step of your training. Some cards only appear when you need them, so your board won't look exactly like your friend's.\n\nReady? Pick your crew job next.",
              "attachments": [
                {
                  "kind": "image",
                  "url": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Mars_Valles_Marineris.jpeg/960px-Mars_Valles_Marineris.jpeg",
                  "name": "Mars, with the canyon Valles Marineris across the middle",
                  "credit": "NASA / JPL / USGS"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "link",
                  "url": "https://science.nasa.gov/mars/",
                  "name": "NASA: All about Mars"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "p-crew",
              "kind": "choice",
              "title": "Pick your crew job",
              "poll": true,
              "signup": {
                "max": 3,
                "names": true
              },
              "minutes": 1,
              "body": "Every crew needs all four jobs. Up to three cadets per job, so pick fast!",
              "questions": [
                {
                  "id": "q",
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "text": "Which job do you want on the crew?",
                  "options": [
                    "Pilot",
                    "Engineer",
                    "Botanist",
                    "Medic"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "q-trip",
              "kind": "choice",
              "title": "How far is Mars?",
              "minutes": 2,
              "body": "Mars is our neighbour, but neighbours in space are a long way apart.",
              "questions": [
                {
                  "id": "q",
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "text": "How long does the trip to Mars take?",
                  "options": [
                    "About 7 months",
                    "About 3 days",
                    "About 10 years"
                  ],
                  "answer": 0,
                  "explain": "With today's rockets it takes about 7 months, when Earth and Mars are on the same side of the Sun.",
                  "next": [
                    null,
                    "c-big",
                    "c-big"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "c-big",
              "kind": "content",
              "title": "Space is BIG",
              "minutes": 2,
              "body": "Not quite! The Moon is 3 days away, but Mars is about **150 times further**.\n\nIf you drove a car to Mars at motorway speed without stopping, you'd arrive in about **100 years**. A rocket is much faster, but the trip still takes about **7 months**.\n\nPack some good books. 📚"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pack the rocket",
          "goal": "Choose what the crew needs, and pass the fuel check.",
          "modules": [
            {
              "id": "q-pack",
              "kind": "choice",
              "title": "What goes on board?",
              "minutes": 2,
              "body": "Every kilogram costs fuel, so only take what you need.",
              "questions": [
                {
                  "id": "q",
                  "kind": "multi",
                  "text": "Tick everything the crew needs.",
                  "options": [
                    "Oxygen",
                    "Water",
                    "Food",
                    "Your bicycle",
                    "A spare spacesuit"
