            {
              "id": "c-fix",
              "kind": "content",
              "title": "Fix-it list",
              "minutes": 2,
              "body": "The inspector found a few problems. 🔧\n\n- The air outside is mostly **carbon dioxide**: always wear your suit.\n- There's no rain on Mars. Water comes from **ice**, which we dig up, melt and clean.\n\nRead the first card again, then carry on to the greenhouse.",
              "attachments": [
