              "body": "Draw your greenhouse (on paper or with **Draw**), then add a photo or your drawing here.\n\nLabel:\n1. Where the light comes from\n2. Where the water comes from\n3. Three plants you'd grow, and why",
              "criteria": "A labelled drawing with light, water and three plants.",
